attribution: Words and music credited to Nora Bayes (died 1928) and Jack Norworth (died 1959), who introduced it in the Ziegfeld Follies of 1908; published by Jerome H. Remick & Co. in 1908. Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
